media/223002887.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,7,0,"<p>Work inside the passenger compartment and remove the front carpet, in the area of the centre pillar, to gain access to the ABS connectors.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connectors (1a), (1b), (1c), (1d), (1e), (1f), (1g), (1h).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Right rear wheel sensor for ABS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004988\">See K76 RIGHT REAR WHEEL SENSOR FOR ABS ( FRONT )</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Left rear wheel sensor for ABS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004985\">See K75 LEFT REAR WHEEL SENSOR FOR ABS ( FRONT )</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Front/air conditioning - heater coupling</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004487\">See D008 FRONT/AIR CONDITIONING - HEATER COUPLING</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Brake pedal switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004813\">See I30 BRAKE PEDAL SWITCH ( FRONT )</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure clas